# HP40gs Stock Font Gallery through the original APLET UI and serial disk.
# HP40gs boots through the CAS front end, then follows the same lazy HPGCC
# transfer path. Keep Gallery navigation out of the transfer window.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6
13000 tap home
15000 tap aplet
16000 capture aplet-library
17000 tap f5
18000 capture receive-menu
18500 tap down
19200 tap down
19900 tap down
20200 capture receive-serial-disk
20600 tap enter
40000 capture remote-aplet
41500 tap enter
43000 capture lazy-fetch

# The previous Stock Gallery failure showed that one late ENTER reaches the
# HPGCC aplet launch screen after transfer has completed, but does not yet enter
# HPC1. Confirm the launch with a second ENTER. On a faster run that is already
# inside Gallery, the extra ENTER merely toggles sample/text and is harmless.
# Capture both page states for each native face so the ROM-pixel oracle is
# independent of that launch/toggle race.
43500 monitor 450000
410000 tap enter
416000 tap enter
428000 capture native-mini
431000 tap enter
434000 capture native-mini-other
437000 tap down
440000 capture native-main
443000 tap enter
446000 capture native-main-other
449000 tap down
452000 capture native-editline
455000 tap enter
458000 capture native-editline-other
461000 tap right
464000 capture generated-control
467000 tap on
